  "title": "Strawberry Rhubarb Custard Pie",
  "description": "The rhubarb custard pie from Chef John has the perfect combo of tart rhubarb sweetened with fresh strawberries and rich custard in a buttery crust.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
